    "title": "Santa Barbara's New Bombay Station 734 Brings All-Day Indian Fare to State Street - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Indy Staff ,\n8 hours ago The aroma of warm spices meets warm hospitality at Bombay Station 734, where owners Ninder Josan and Kuldeep Singh are serving up something different. The brothers, who also helm Apna Indian Kitchen just down the block on State Street, here offer vibrant Bombay street food and traditional Indian dishes for breakfast, brunch, lunch, and a newly added early dinner, along with specialty coffees and house-made chai. Read full article",
